0..78 Comment "//! A ring buffer held other than exactly once. The kernel owns a buffer while"
79..146 Comment "//! an operation is in flight and hands it back with the completion"
147..227 Comment "//! [boats-2020-notes_on_io_uring]: a buffer never handed back leaks its slot in"
228..308 Comment "//! the registered area, one handed back twice is reclaimed while the kernel may"
309..385 Comment "//! still own it, and one read while held would observe bytes the kernel may"
386..407 Comment "//! still be writing."
408..411 Comment "//!"
412..448 Comment "//! - see: #1792 — `freedInOneArm`"
449..492 Comment "//! - cites: [boats-2020-notes_on_io_uring]"
493..496 Comment "//!"
